  "uprn": 10001265814,
  "decision_date": "12/06/2026",
  "description": "Change of use of first floor from nursery to residential units",
  "site_name": null,
  "last_updated_by": "PP overwrite repair",
  "decision_target_date": "12/06/2026",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 3LF",
  "street_name": "Staines Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Other change of use",
  "lapsed_date": "12/06/2029",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the use of the first floor for community use is no longer required through suitable evidence and to demonstrate that there is no need for nursery places in the local area contrary to London Plan policy S3 and Local Plan policies CI1 and CI2. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not prejudice the viability of the existing nursery use contrary to London Plan policy D13 and Local Plan policy EQ5.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal has failed to demonstrate that there would not be unacceptable levels of overlooking to existing habitable room windows at neighbouring sites contrary to Local Plan policies SC4 and CC2 and the London Plan Housing SPG.   ",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal would provide cramped and substandard quality of accommodation, lack of amenity space and fails to demonstrate that a suitable noise environment would be provided for future residents contrary to London Plan policy D6 and Local Plan policies SC4, SC5 and EQ5.",
    "Reason : 5 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that residents would have easy and convenient access to cycle parking and that there would be a satisfactory arrangement for the storage and collection of waste and recycling on site contrary to London Plan policy T5 and Local Plan policies EC2 and EQ7.",
    "Reason : 6 - The proposal has failed to demonstrate that opportunities for reducing carbon dioxide emissions on site has been maximised contrary to emerging and adopted Local Plan policy EQ1 and EQ2. "
  ],
